YOUR TASK: BATCH-63/TASK-02 — Frontend Tree Visualization

Create a React component that renders the search tree as an interactive SVG.

FILES IN SCOPE:
  - frontend/src/components/pipeline/tree-visualization.tsx (create)
  - frontend/src/pages/run-detail.tsx (modify — add tree tab when tree_data exists)
  - frontend/src/components/__tests__/tree-visualization.test.tsx (create)

ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:
  AC-02-01: TreeVisualization renders interactive SVG from tree_data
  AC-02-02: Run Detail page shows tree tab when tree_data exists
  AC-02-03: No additional API calls needed (HB-02)

HARD BOUNDARIES:
  HB-02: Tree visualization MUST NOT make additional API calls — renders from embedded data

REQUIRED TESTS:
  TEST-63-02-01: Renders tree nodes from tree_data prop
  TEST-63-02-02: Shows "No tree data" message when tree_data is null
  TEST-63-02-03: Highlights top-scored node

TREE DATA SHAPE (from TASK-01):
```typescript
interface TreeData {
  nodes: Array<{
    id: string;
    title: string;
    score: number;
    depth: number;
    parent_ids: string[];
  }>;
  edges: Array<{
    from: string;
    to: string;
